  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance",
      "text": "中文 · [English](./README.en.md)\n\n可搜索的模型选择器与多模态「图片」能力标签。附件上传复用官方输入栏回形针。\n\n仓库：[GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance)"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance#v0.3.6\n```\n\n安装后请**完全重启** `dsh web`（或 Desktop Host），并用打印的 `?token=` 地址打开。"
    },
    {
      "section": "能做什么",
      "text": "- **最近模型**：输入栏旁显示最近用过的模型，一点即切\n- **搜索选模型**：按名称搜索，可按提供方筛选，可只看支持图片的模型\n- **图片标签**：支持图片输入的模型名称旁显示「图片」"
    },
    {
      "section": "怎么用",
      "text": "1. 打开任意对话\n2. 点模型选择区域 → 搜索或筛选想要的模型；需要识图时打开「仅图片」\n3. 需要发图时用官方输入栏回形针选择附件，再发送"
    },
    {
      "section": "说明",
      "text": "- **不依赖** SupaNexus Core 也能搜索、切换模型\n- 「图片」标签需要当前模型已声明支持图片输入（例如通过 Core 快速配置 / OAuth 写入）；否则筛选/标签会保持不可用，不影响其它功能\n- 附件上传由 dsh ≥ 0.1.3 官方 InputBar 提供（图片 + 通用文件）；无图模态模型仍可挂通用文件，仅拒绝图片 intake（能力未知时不拦截，与官方提交时校验一致）"
    },
    {
      "section": "可选配置",
      "text": "```yaml\nconfig:\n  maxRecent: 4   # 最近模型芯片数量\n```\n\n也可在设置 → 插件中调整（若界面提供该项）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    },
    {
      "section": "@supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance",
      "text": "[中文](./README.md) · English\n\nSearchable model picker and vision capability tags for DeepSeek Harness. Attachment upload uses the official InputBar paperclip.\n\nRepo: [GitHub](https://github.com/supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:supanexus/dsh-plugin-chat-enhance#v0.3.6\n```\n\nFully restart `dsh web` (or Desktop Host) after install, then open the printed `?token=` URL."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- **Recent models** — quick chips for models you used lately\n- **Searchable picker** — filter by provider; optional “Images only”\n- **Image tag** — marks models that accept image input"
    },
    {
      "section": "How to use",
      "text": "1. Open any conversation\n2. Open the model control → search or filter; turn on “Images only” when you need vision\n3. Use the official composer paperclip to attach files, then send"
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- Model search/switch works **without** SupaNexus Core\n- Vision tags need the selected model to declare image input (often via Core Quick Setup / OAuth). Otherwise those filters stay inactive.\n- Attachment upload is provided by dsh ≥ 0.1.3 official InputBar (images + generic files). Non-vision models still accept generic files; only image intake is refused. Unknown capability fails open (official submit-time checks still apply)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Optional config",
      "text": "```yaml\nconfig:\n  maxRecent: 4   # number of recent-model chips\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT © SupaNexus"
    }
  ],
